+### 1. Security Fixes (Priority 1) ✅
+
+#### A. Input Sanitization for Contact Properties
+**File:** `admin/admin.php` (lines 176-188)
+
+**Implementation:**
+```php
+// Sanitize contact properties to prevent data integrity and XSS issues
+$contact_data = array();
+if ( isset( $_POST['contact'] ) && is_array( $_POST['contact'] ) ) {
+    foreach ( $_POST['contact'] as $key => $value ) {
+        $sanitized_key = sanitize_key( $key );
+        if ( is_array( $value ) ) {
+            $contact_data[$sanitized_key] = array_map( 'sanitize_text_field', $value );
+        } else {
+            $contact_data[$sanitized_key] = sanitize_text_field( $value );
+        }
+    }
+}
+$post->props = $contact_data;
+```
+
+**Impact:**
+- Prevents XSS attacks through contact properties
+- Ensures data integrity
+- Handles nested arrays properly
+
+#### B. Contact Name Field Sanitization
+**File:** `admin/admin.php` (lines 190-193)
+
+**Implementation:**
+```php
+// Sanitize contact name field
+$post->name = isset( $_POST['contact']['name'] )
+    ? sanitize_text_field( trim( $_POST['contact']['name'] ) )
+    : '';
+```
+
+**Impact:**
+- Prevents XSS in contact names
+- Handles missing name field gracefully
+- Combines sanitization with trimming
+
+### 2. Error Handling Improvements ✅
+
+#### A. Contact Class Error Handling
+**File:** `includes/class-contact.php` (lines 273-280, 293-299)
+
+**Implementation:**
+```php
+// Check for errors during post insertion
+if ( is_wp_error( $post_id ) ) {
+    error_log( sprintf(
+        'Flamingo: Failed to save contact "%s" - %s',
+        $this->email,
+        $post_id->get_error_message()
+    ) );
+    return false;
+}
+
+// Check for errors during term assignment
+if ( is_wp_error( $term_result ) ) {
+    error_log( sprintf(
+        'Flamingo: Failed to set tags for contact "%s" - %s',
+        $this->email,
+        $term_result->get_error_message()
+    ) );
+}
+```
+
+**Impact:**
+- Detects database operation failures
+- Logs errors for debugging
+- Returns false on failure instead of invalid post ID
+- Improves reliability
+
+#### B. Inbound Message Class Error Handling
+**File:** `includes/class-inbound-message.php` (lines 399-407)
+
+**Implementation:**
+```php
+// Check for errors during post insertion
+if ( is_wp_error( $post_id ) ) {
+    error_log( sprintf(
+        'Flamingo: Failed to save inbound message "%s" - %s',
+        $this->subject,
+        $post_id->get_error_message()
+    ) );
+    return false;
+}
+```
+
+**Impact:**
+- Same benefits as Contact class
+- Consistent error handling across plugin
+- Easier troubleshooting
